Directives
<HEADING>==========</HEADING>

<PUNCTUATION>.. </PUNCTUATION><KEYWORD>note</KEYWORD><PUNCTUATION>::</PUNCTUATION>
   This is a note admonition.

<PUNCTUATION>.. </PUNCTUATION><KEYWORD>warning</KEYWORD><PUNCTUATION>::</PUNCTUATION>
   Be careful with this operation!

<PUNCTUATION>.. </PUNCTUATION><KEYWORD>code-block</KEYWORD><PUNCTUATION>::</PUNCTUATION><STRING> python</STRING>

   def fibonacci(n):
       """Calculate fibonacci number."""
       if n &lt;= 1:
           return n
       return fibonacci(n - 1) + fibonacci(n - 2)

<PUNCTUATION>.. </PUNCTUATION><KEYWORD>image</KEYWORD><PUNCTUATION>::</PUNCTUATION><STRING> images/logo.png</STRING>
   <ATTRIBUTE>:alt:</ATTRIBUTE><STRING> Project Logo</STRING>
